    "issues": [
     {
      "id": "V1",
      "path": "sections.today.1",
      "category": "parity",
      "severity": "fix",
      "problem": "中文写明是「当年韩信」解缚、师事李左车，结论句的主语是「赢家」。英文写成 \"Untying the bonds and serving Li Zuoche as a teacher is exactly that: the person most worth asking...\"，丢了行为人韩信，也丢了「赢家」这一主语。结果中英意思不完全对应，英文读者看不出是谁做了这件事。",
      "evidence": [
       {
        "id": "J-E7",
        "quote": "信乃解其縛，東鄉坐，西鄉對，師事之"
       }
      ],
      "proposed": "英文改为：\"When Han Xin untied Li Zuoche's bonds and served him as a teacher, he was doing exactly that: the person a winner most needs to ask is often not his own adviser, but the one on the other side who went unheard.\""
     }
    ],
    "overall": "定稿的史实、引文、归属、时序和推断标注都有证据支撑或已明确标为解释；只有 today.1 的英文丢了行为人和「赢家」主语，需要做一处小的中英对齐修改。",
    "_content_sha256": "7cb5bb4cef6ebf035db060601718a96bef7a2b8ba5ddf2d131eee35de4f5d203"
